  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "curating-the-tales",
      "title": "Curating the tales",
      "anchor": "Curating_the_tales",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:thjs5g",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Curator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Curator</a> at the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Heart_of_Gielinor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Heart of Gielinor</a>, north of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Agility_Pyramid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Agility Pyramid</a> (fairy code <b>D</b><b>L</b><b>Q</b> and run southwest). Make sure to have at least 4 open inventory spots.",
          "text": "Talk to The Curator at the Heart of Gielinor, north of the Agility Pyramid (fairy code DLQ and run southwest). Make sure to have at least 4 open inventory spots.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "✓",
                  "text": "[Accept Quest]"
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "[Continue...]"
                },
                {
                  "key": "4",
                  "text": "[More...]"
                },
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "Goodbye."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:1ct7kku",
          "html": "Be sure to bring the chapters with you to fill them.",
          "text": "Be sure to bring the chapters with you to fill them.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:1df4ne3",
          "html": "For chapter #1, collect 20 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Memory_fragment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">memory fragments</a> (the green orbs) at the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Incandescent_wisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">incandescent wisp</a> Divination colony, south of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Poison_Waste\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Poison Waste</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Isafdar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Isafdar</a>, west of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Castle_Wars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Castle Wars</a> (fairy code <b>B</b><b>K</b><b>P</b> and run west). This will grant 250 Divination XP each, 5,000 Divination XP in total.",
          "text": "For chapter #1, collect 20 memory fragments (the green orbs) at the incandescent wisp Divination colony, south of the Poison Waste in Isafdar, west of Castle Wars (fairy code BKP and run west). This will grant 250 Divination XP each, 5,000 Divination XP in total.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:1ii1cwz",
          "html": "For chapter #2, use the empty chapter on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Barrows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Barrows</a> reward chest. This step will grant you 5,000 Summoning XP.",
          "text": "For chapter #2, use the empty chapter on the Barrows reward chest. This step will grant you 5,000 Summoning XP.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:1hokbhj",
          "html": "For chapter #3, kill 40 Zamorak creatures in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/God_Wars_Dungeon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">God Wars Dungeon</a> to gain access to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/K%27ril_Tsutsaroth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">K&#39;ril Tsutsaroth</a> (killcount is not required if <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Totem_of_Intimidation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Totem of Intimidation</a> is active on <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Anachronia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anachronia</a>, or if you have unlocked <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/War%27s_Blessing_2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">War&#39;s Blessing 2</a>). Kill K&#39;ril Tsutsaroth once at the God Wars Dungeon (practice or hard mode also count).",
          "text": "For chapter #3, kill 40 Zamorak creatures in the God Wars Dungeon to gain access to K'ril Tsutsaroth (killcount is not required if Totem of Intimidation is active on Anachronia, or if you have unlocked War's Blessing 2). Kill K'ril Tsutsaroth once at the God Wars Dungeon (practice or hard mode also count).",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:1br0zq8",
          "html": "For chapter #4, kill 20 each of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Young_grotworms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">young grotworms</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Grotworms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">grotworms</a>, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mature_grotworms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mature grotworms</a> in any order at the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Grotworm_Lair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Grotworm Lair</a>, the entrance of which is at the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/White_Knight_Camp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">White Knight Camp</a>, west of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Port_Sarim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Port Sarim</a>. This step will grant you 5,000 Slayer XP.",
          "text": "For chapter #4, kill 20 each of young grotworms, grotworms, and mature grotworms in any order at the Grotworm Lair, the entrance of which is at the White Knight Camp, west of Port Sarim. This step will grant you 5,000 Slayer XP.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:1ys2sp7",
          "html": "Return to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Heart_of_Gielinor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Heart of Gielinor</a>.",
          "text": "Return to the Heart of Gielinor.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:9weyr1",
          "html": "<i>Read</i> the floating <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tome_(Tales_of_the_God_Wars)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tome</a> to deposit the chapters.",
          "text": "Read the floating tome to deposit the chapters.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Add the chapters to the tome."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:1cmcyow",
          "html": "Read the tome again and select the final memory; watch the cutscene. You do not have to watch the other memories to complete the miniquest, but you have to watch them if you want to unlock the music tracks for the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Music_Maestro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Music Maestro</a> achievement.",
          "text": "Read the tome again and select the final memory; watch the cutscene. You do not have to watch the other memories to complete the miniquest, but you have to watch them if you want to unlock the music tracks for the Music Maestro achievement.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Yes."
                },
                {
                  "key": "4",
                  "text": "[More...]"
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Final memory."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:1jiu9lt",
          "html": "Talk to The Curator.",
          "text": "Talk to The Curator.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "curating-the-tales:1eh5umu",
          "html": "Miniquest complete!",
          "text": "Miniquest complete!",
